%% How an agent asks a person for a file with gloss.
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant G as gloss --pick
    participant P as Person
    A->>G: start a detached pick
    G-->>A: URL and resume token
    A->>P: share the URL
    P->>G: choose or drop files
    P->>G: Send
    A->>G: --resume TOKEN
    G-->>A: chosen paths, exit 0
